<title>THAILAND: Rutherford-Moran to start Thai natgas supply.</title>
<headline>Rutherford-Moran to start Thai natgas supply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rutherford Moran Oil Corp and its partners will start supplying 75 million cubic feet per day of natural gas from their Thai Tantawan field from March 15 to state-owned Petroleum Authority of Thailand (PTT), a senior PPT official said on Monday.</p>
</text>
